        "superseded_error": null,
        "superseded_justification": "Attempt 0002's complete divergence is caused by upstream America/New_York TIMESTAMPTZ normalization. fhir_observation_chartevents.sql:9,67 writes shifted charttime to Observation.effectiveDateTime, and fhir_encounter_icu.sql:31-32,97-100 writes shifted ICU times to Encounter.period. All 38 only-oracle and 32 only-candidate rows are key-attributed with no residual, including six collisions propagated through LEAD and UNION ALL. Of 56 conflicts, 39 replay directly and the remaining 17 close under full transformed-source replay as 9 ICU arithmetic and 8 chartevents window effects. Original wall times are absent from served FHIR and opaque resource IDs are not inverted. The rare 0.0206% conflict fraction is DST-consistent, and the contract's upstream-DST exemption applies.",
